OL,3,AMen guilty of abusing woman drugged and
OL,4,Aadvertised for sex by husband
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour men have been found guilty of
OL,7,Fsexually abusing a woman whose husband
OL,8,Fdrugged and secretly advertised her for
OL,9,Fsex on the internet, in the first trial
OL,10,Fof its kind in the UK.
OL,12,FPhilip Young, 50, had already pleaded
OL,13,Fguilty to multiple charges of drugging
OL,14,Fand raping his wife, Joanne Young, over
OL,15,Fa 13-year period at their home in
OL,16,FSwindon, Wiltshire.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
