OL,3,AMen guilty of abusing woman drugged and
OL,4,Aadvertised for sex by husband
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorman Macksoni, 48, Richard Wilkins,
OL,7,F62, Connor Sanderson-Doyle, 32, and
OL,8,FMohammed Hassan, 38, were found guilty
OL,9,Fof multiple sexual offences by a jury
OL,10,Fat Winchester Crown Court. Wilkins and
OL,11,FMacksoni were each found guilty of one
OL,12,Fcount of rape.
OL,14,FJoanne Young, who divorced Philip Young
OL,15,Flast year, beamed at police as she left
OL,16,Fcourt wiping her eyes.
